SDL-E1032 (spec/index.md)

  x the parens are mandatory — write `bm25: (1.2, 0.75);`
   ,----
 1 | index fulltext f { on: t; fields: a; bm25: 1.2, 0.75; };
   :                                      ^^^^^|^^^^
   :                                           `-- not a `(<k1>, <b>)` pair
   `----
  help: write `bm25: (<k1>, <b>);` — the parens are mandatory and exactly two numbers are taken, e.g. `bm25: (1.2, 0.75);`
